@startuml
title Dependency, Packaging & Public API Associations
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam roundcorner 0

class "Core" as Core <<Component>> {
  standard-library-only
  domain contracts
}
class "Prefect Integration Package" as PIP <<Component>> {
  Prefect opt-in extra
}
class "Public API" as PA <<Component>> {
  curated stable boundary
  core + prefect public APIs
}
class "gpwcf Distribution" as Dist <<Component>> {
  single distribution + optional Prefect extra
}
class "Setuptools Build Backend" as SB <<Component>> {
  setuptools==84.2.1 / build_meta
}
class "core.identities" as CI <<Module>> {
  nominal identity value types
}
class "core.diagnostics" as CD <<Module>> {
  optional diagnostic value contract
}

Dist ..> Core : includes
Dist ..> PIP : includes optional extra
Core --> PA : exposes Core API
PIP --> PA : exposes Integration API
PIP .> Prefect : optional dependency (never Core)
Dist --> SB : isolated build backend
Core ..> CI : identity module
Core ..> CD : diagnostics module (optional)
CI .- CD : distinct modules

note right of Dist : Core installs & imports without Prefect
Forbidden dependency directions remain prohibited

@enduml